  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to the Development of the Soursop Value Chains in Grenada</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To improve evidence base for transparent decision making for the development of  soursop value chain.

To increase stakeholder participation and formation of a governance structure for sustainable growth of the soursop value chain.

To enhance capacities of small farmers and agro-processors for increased supplies of fresh and processed soursop products to the domestic market.

To strengthening the efficiency of soursop planting material production and orchard management for improved productivity and better management of established trees and orchards.</narrative>
  </description>
